"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{dIP}\">\\(\\mathbf{dIP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ae1972e19732da\" href=\"?note=86ae1972e19732da\" title=\"28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof\">28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{dIP}=\\mathbf{NP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{dIP}=\\mathbf{NP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>NP⊆dIP：验证器发空询问，证明者给出整条非确定型接受分支的多项式长猜测，验证器确定模拟并检查接受。反向以所有a_i,b_i作为证书；逐项检查验证器询问与最终接受，消息数量、消息长度和V的运行时间均多项式。若一致且接受，可在这些有限历史上定义P返回相应b_i，在其他历史任取值，故存在真实接受策略；不同轮历史的编码分量个数不同，没有冲突。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 8.4 and proof；印刷 pp.145 / PDF pp.171。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof","status":"resolved","id":"86ae1972e19732da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof","status":"resolved","id":"86ae1972e19732da","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{dIP}$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]；$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{dIP}$ 见 [[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]；$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{dIP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{dIP}=\\mathbf{NP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1504,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"}],"outgoing":["86ae1972e19732da","0cb5248561455df8"]}